{"id":4776,"title":{"romaji":"Meitantei Precure!","english":"Star Detective Precure!","native":"名探偵プリキュア！"},"slug":"meitantei_precure","synopsis":"The 23rd installment of the long-running Precure series.\n\nAnna Akechi is a second-year junior high student living in Makoto Mirai Town. On her 14th birthday, she has a chance encounter with a fairy named Pochitan, and a magical pendant caused her to travel back in time from 2027 to 1999! In the Makoto Mirai Town 28 years in the past, Anna meets Mikuru Kobayashi, a girl her age who wants to become a great detective.\n\nMeanwhile, people in town are in trouble as their prized possessions are being stolen from under their noses - the cause being a group of Phantom Thieves. To stop them, Anna and Mikuru turn into Pretty Cures! Maybe if they solve these mysteries, Anna can find her way back to her own time?\n\n(Source: AniList)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2026,"createdAt":"2026-02-01 03:26:41","updatedAt":"2026-02-01 03:26:41","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":202957},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":null},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":19742},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":50362},{"site":"MAL","externalId":63042},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":38058},{"site":"LIVECHART","externalId":13405},{"site":"X","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":13569,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/H3JdcMKoWBvqL0XSZ61jJJsYoBJwW4V6UUPBLXJO.avif"},{"id":13570,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/OB903O4I2U1qOLKS6c0e8Rw5oGOH7zLTLoFIsRLa.jpg"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":38,"name":"Toei Animation","slug":"toei_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":132,"name":"Precure","slug":"precure"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":14234,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":14147,"title":{"romaji":"Heart ni Hint! Meitantei Precure!","native":"ハートにヒント！名探偵プリキュア！"},"performances":[{"alias":null,"as":null,"memberAlias